167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 142 0 R
/T (The rapid growth of e-commerce and online shopping has significantly increased the demand for efficient logistics and courier services. However, many logistics operations still face challenges such as delayed deliveries, poor shipment visibility, manual record management, inefficient warehouse coordination, and lack of real-time tracking. These issues often result in operational inefficiencies, customer dissatisfaction, and increased delivery costs. The proposed Smart Logistics and Courier Tracking System aims to address these challenges by providing a centralized digital platform that manages courier operations, enables real-time shipment tracking, optimizes delivery management, and improves communication among customers, warehouse staff, delivery personnel, and administrators.)
/E (The rapid growth of e-commerce and online shopping has significantly increased the demand for efficient logistics and courier services. However, many logistics operations still face challenges such as delayed deliveries, poor shipment visibility, manual record management, inefficient warehouse coordination, and lack of real-time tracking. These issues often result in operational inefficiencies, customer dissatisfaction, and increased delivery costs. The proposed Smart Logistics and Courier Tracking System aims to address these challenges by providing a centralized digital platform that manages courier operations, enables real-time shipment tracking, optimizes delivery management, and improves communication among customers, warehouse staff, delivery personnel, and administrators.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
